  1292→\label{tab:corrected_efficiency}
  1293→\begin{tabular}{lcccc}
  1294→\hline
  1295→System & FP-FSP & KrylovFSP (default) & KrylovFSP (best tuned) & Verdict \\
  1296→\hline
