  1298→Bottleneck & 1.0\,s & ${<}0.1$\,s, $\langle C\rangle{=}0.12$ (wavefront trunc.) & 0.9\,s, $\langle C\rangle{\approx}4.72$ (${\sim}5\%$ err) & FP-FSP: ${<}0.1\%$ err \\
  1299→Robertson $t_f{=}10^4$ & $1{,}117$\,s, $662$k steps & DNF ($\tau$-lock, absorbing gen.) & DNF (same $\tau$-lock) & FP-FSP wins \\
